Spoilers follow:








Ways to get water for making holy water:
1. Dip potions in fountains to dilute them.
2. Dip unicorn horns into bad potions (sickness, confusion, etc.)
3. Zap useless potions with a wand of cancellation. (I think that you have
to be carrying the potions, and then zap yourself. Make sure you've dropped
everything useful first!)

Methods (1) and (3) also work for making blank scrolls.

On another topic, I had a stupid death involving method (3). I had a high level
barabrian, lots of great stuff including Stormbringer, and I had just killed
off a ghost with a tremendous pile of goodies. A trip to the altar confirmed
that most of the stuff was cursed. So I figured, "Hey, I've got two wands that
made engravings vanish -- one of them is probably cancellation." So I dropped
my good stuff (including all weapons) and zapped myself. The wand teleported
me, I immediately fell through a trap door, and then ran into a cockatrice.
"You hit it [with bare hands!]. You turn to stone..."

